// ---- per (edge slot, slice) edge identity ------------------------
// EB_U / EB_V name the two endpoints by NODE slot; EB_DU / EB_DV are the
// direction indices at each end; EB_NU / EB_NV are the endpoints' BANK
// addresses and EB_ABN the `above` edge's CELL INDEX (ECELLX = none);
